<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8">
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1">
		<title>403 — 访问被拒绝</title>
<style>
  *{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
    body{
	        text-align:center;padding:50px;margin:0;width:100vw;height:100vh;
		    font-family:PingFang SC,-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",Roboto,"Helvetica Neue",Arial,sans-serif;
		      }
      .container{
	          display:flex;width:100%;height:100%;flex-direction:column;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
		    }
        .cover img{
		    display:block;max-width:400px;height:auto;margin:0 auto;
		      }
	  h1{color:#3a3a3a;font-size:28px}
	    .label{
		        display:inline-block;background-color:#fcefe7;border-radius:6px;color:#ff6000;
			    padding:0 20px;font-size:16px;line-height:3em;margin-bottom:20px;
			      }
	      .ip-box{
		          display:inline-block;background:#f9fafb;border-radius:8px;padding:12px 24px;
			      margin-bottom:16px;font-size:14px;color:#667085;
			        }
	        .ip-box .ip{font-family:SF Mono,Menlo,monospace;color:#3a3a3a;font-weight:600;font-size:16px}
		  .ip-box .loc{font-size:12px;color:#98a2b3;margin-top:2px}
		    .contact{font-size:14px;color:#98a2b3}
		      .contact b{color:#ff6000;font-weight:600}
		        .dots{animation:dots 1.5s infinite}
			  @keyframes dots{0%,20%{opacity:0}50%{opacity:1}100%{opacity:1}}
</style>
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="container">
			  <div class="cover"><img src="https://image.uisdc.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/Refresh-tips.png"></div>
			    <h1>Wo! 客官您被拦下啦</h1>
			      <p class="label">安全策略拦截 · 403</p>
			        <div class="ip-box">
					    <div>您的 IP：<span class="ip" id="uip">加载中<span class="dots">...</span></span></div>
					        <div class="loc" id="uloc"></div>
						  </div>
						    <p class="contact">若为正常访问误报，请联系<br>微信：<b>uisdc5687</b></p>
		</div>
	<script>
		fetch('https://ip.uisdc.com/json/')
  .then(function(r){return r.json()})
  .then(function(d){
	      var o=d.data;
	      document.getElementById('uip').textContent=o.ip;
	      document.getElementById('uloc').textContent=o.cname+(o.isp?' · '+o.isp:'');
	    })
  .catch(function(){
	      document.getElementById('uip').textContent='获取失败';
	    });
	</script>
	</body>
</html>
